<h1 id="qimqui-title" style="color:#0d47a1;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #90caf9;padding-bottom:0.25em;margin-top:0"><code>qimqui</code> — quick implement (classic chain)</h1>

Use when the user includes **`qimqui`**. Faster than **`onlyref` → `aciub` → `implref`** when the task is already named and bounded in the conversation (e.g. <code>CR_Task2</code>, “remove E2B”, “flatten SCS scopes”).

