<h2 id="qimqui-when" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. When this applies</h2>

| User says | Agent does |
|-----------|------------|
| **`qimqui`** + task label (e.g. <code>CR_Task2</code>, “remove E2B”) | [Procedure](#qimqui-procedure) on **in-thread scope**. |
| **`qimqui`** + existing plan **`.md` path** | Treat plan as scope; skip mini-plan step; go straight to execute chain. |
| **`qimqui`** alone | Use the **most recent named task** in the thread; if none, ask **one** question: which task or plan path? |

**Examples:**

```text
qimqui CR_Task2 remove E2B end-to-end
qimqui cursor_gen/refactor_plans/wip/REFACTOR_REMOVE_E2B_CLITICS.md
```

