<h2 id="qimqui-self" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">8. Self-check (agent)</h2>

- [ ] User invoked **`qimqui`**.
- [ ] Scope locked; phases have `[ ]` + Quality bar.
- [ ] Plan path exists (mini-plan or user-named).
- [ ] **aciub** + **implref** chain started — not plan-only handoff.
- [ ] If user wanted TDD: redirected mentally to **`qimpltdd`** (they must say the keyword).
